What do you mean?

304
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:00,120
What?

305
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:03,120
Yeah, that's more like it.

306
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:04,820
Thanks, favorite landlady.

307
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:07,120
Well, Lu Guang, you know what to do.

308
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,020
Come here.

309
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:09,620
Huh?

310
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:11,520
Wait, Lu Guang?

311
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:12,920
Not cool.

312
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:14,420
Seriously?

313
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:15,220
Dude, I got shot.

314
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:17,920
The least you can do is help me over to where I can stuff my face.

315
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:23,220
Captain, how's Officer Wang?

316
00:19:25,220 --> 00:19:29,720
Finally out of the woods, but she still has a while before she's recovered.

317
00:19:32,220 --> 00:19:38,120
Plus, for future paranormal stuff, there's a new force, and I'm in charge.

318
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,420
I want to bring lines together.

319
00:19:39,420 --> 00:19:41,420
I want to bring lines together.

320
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:44,420
Make the uncertain, certain.

321
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:45,420
Mm-hmm.

322
00:19:45,420 --> 00:19:46,420
Can you do that?

323
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:53,720
I think it depends.

324
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:56,720
We're still friends, right?

325
00:19:56,720 --> 00:20:07,020
You forgot something.

326
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:09,020
I don't need it.

327
00:20:09,020 --> 00:20:09,520
I don't need it.

328
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:22,320
That hits the spot.

329
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:24,320
Especially after hospital food.

330
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:24,820
Hmm.

331
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:28,820
Hey, why aren't you eating?

332
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,020
Zhang Xiaoxian.

333
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:34,520
I'm sorry.

334
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:40,320
I'm always telling you to leave the past untouched.

335
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:44,020
But I couldn't follow my own words.

336
00:20:44,820 --> 00:20:48,020
Even if I know that death is an unchangeable point,

337
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:51,020
I still want to use the last chance

338
00:20:51,820 --> 00:20:53,520
to go back to the beginning.

339
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:56,620
And save you.

340
00:21:03,620 --> 00:21:05,620
Oh, my God.

341
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:06,620
Teacher, I'll show you.

